{"availability":"available","full":"Razee4315/Vuoom","name":"Vuoom","description":"A free, open-source screen recorder for Windows with cinematic auto-zoom","category":"Developer tools","language":"Rust","stars":18,"forks":1,"created":"2026-06-08T17:20:49Z","updated":"2026-10-09T16:54:23Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://razee4315.github.io/Vuoom/","topics":["auto-zoom","demo","developer-tools","gif","gif-recorder","rust","screen-capture","screen-recorder","screen-studio-alternative","screencast","solidjs","tauri","wgpu","windows"],"demo":"https://razee4315.github.io/Vuoom/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T03:23:25.695Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T03:23:25.695Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T03:23:25.695Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T03:23:25.695Z","stars":18,"forks":1}],"technologies":["Rust"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Screen recordings that zoom where it matters.","A free, open-source screen recorder for Windows with cinematic auto-zoom. Record your screen, the camera glides into the action, and you export a small, crisp demo GIF or MP4 ready for your GitHub README, changelog, Slack, or product post. No account, no watermark, no subscription.","A flat recording of your whole screen makes UI text tiny and the \"wow\" moment invisible. The tools that fix this, the ones that smoothly zoom into each click like a little camera operator (Screen Studio and friends), are Mac-only, paid, or both. Vuoom is that experience as a free Screen Studio alternative for Windows, in a small native app:"],"features":["🎥 Native capture: Windows Graphics Capture at full resolution: a region","(free or 16:9 / 9:16 / 1:1 / 4:5), a whole display, or a single app window, on any monitor, with pause/resume. Capture is paced at the compositor to the frame rate you pick (24 / 30 / 60 fps), so a 144 Hz screen doesn't…","🖱️ A smooth pointer: record without the real cursor and Vuoom draws a","clean one from your movements, gliding (jitter smoothed out with no lag), pressing on every click, sized so it stays legible in a small GIF, scaling with the zoom like the real thing, and (if you like) fading away while…","🎙️ Narration and system sound: record your microphone, everything the"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Razee4315/Vuoom/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"d6f8e609422badaa96ae5139eb23e8f228588f473c1b9235d12a8a64ddfd2e6b","extractedAt":"2026-10-10T03:23:25.801Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T03:23:25.801Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Screen recordings that zoom where it matters.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Razee4315/Vuoom/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"documented","text":"No account, no watermark, no subscription.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Razee4315/Vuoom/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"d6f8e609422badaa96ae5139eb23e8f228588f473c1b9235d12a8a64ddfd2e6b","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Razee4315/Vuoom/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T03:23:25.802Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-09T16:54:23Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Razee4315/Vuoom/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T03:23:25.803Z","hash":"d6f8e609422badaa96ae5139eb23e8f228588f473c1b9235d12a8a64ddfd2e6b","originalBytes":12402,"storedBytes":12402,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["zoom","record","every","export","gif","screen","click","mp4","any","frame","timeline","recording","mock","one","out","right","vuoom","while","windows","app","camera","capture","copy","cut","editor","frames","inspector","size","text","action","cursor","demo","docs","fps","free","full","like","live","never","pnpm","project","region","run","rust","save","shift","small","start","studio","trim","anywhere.","arrow","back","bar","both","built","compressed","countdown","crash","crop","ctrl+","ctrl+shift+z","drag","each","github","hide","home","license","narration","open","own","past